This also includes system prompts - as far as I can tell, whatever is breaking it seems to remove all cache_control parameters from all messages. It's not only the data messages that are an issue - I've seen it happen with tool results too, or possibly when passing in two sequential messages with the same role (which seems to trigger logic to combine them into one message with an array of content).

