https://github.com/vercel/ai/commit/00114c5d0c606ea01ca614606e2b6499666e52d1

https://github.com/vercel/ai/blob/ai%404.0.38/packages/ai/core/generate-text/generate-text.ts#L483

https://github.com/vercel/ai/blob/ai%404.0.39/packages/ai/core/generate-text/generate-text.ts#L499


so these complex fields went from being ignored -> causing errors on structuredClone, which is a bit unfortunate. what this means is that i think any tool return of a complex object will fail

