You need to set the `reasoningEffort` provider option to enable reasoning, see https://ai-sdk.dev/providers/ai-sdk-providers/openai#responses-models

And if you want to see the reasoning, you need to enable `reasoningSummaries` as well.

E.g. this code:
```ts
