In case someone else stumbles over this here is my solution (zod v3):

```javascript
const _schema = validationSchema
  ? jsonSchema(zodToJsonSchema(schema), {
      validate: (data) => {
        const {
          success,
          data: value,
          error,
        } = validationSchema.safeParse(data)
        return success
          ? { success: true, value }
          : { success: false, error }
      },
    })
  : schema
```
`_schema` can then be used as parameter for `streamObject` etc.

