one thing to note: `maxSteps` was removed in SDK 6 and replaced with `stopWhen`. if you're still using `maxSteps`, it will be silently ignored and the default `stopWhen = stepCountIs(1)` kicks in, which stops after the first step (right after tool results).

```typescript
// SDK 5
streamText({ maxSteps: 5 })

// SDK 6
import { stepCountIs } from 'ai';
streamText({ stopWhen: stepCountIs(5) })
```

